.claude/plans/PLAN-169/repass-ga/diff-ga-4.patch:993: | `night_mode_toggled` (v2.54) | `action`, `mode` (str — CLOSED enum: `acceptEdits` / `manual` / `absent` / `other`; off-enum COERCED to `other`, never echoed — `bypassPermissions` is deliberately ABSENT from the enum so a tampered value can never be laundered into the signed chain as a legitimate posture), `previous_mode` (same closed enum), `result` (str — CLOSED enum: `applied` / `noop` / `refused` / `failed` / `other`), `hostname_hash` (str — EXACT 12-lowercase-hex sha256 prefix of the machine hostname, or exactly ""; bounded shape `([0-9a-f]{12})?`, RAW value validated — off-shape incl. oversize DROPPED to "", never truncated; the raw hostname is FORBIDDEN on the wire), `session_id`, `project`, `event_schema`, `ts`, plus baseline `tokens_*`/`hmac`/`hmac_error`. PLAN-165 P2 / ADR-185 (2026-08-03) — records that the per-machine autonomy posture was toggled by `/night-mode`, emitted by `.claude/scripts/night-mode.py` on EVERY terminating path of `on`/`off` (applied/noop/refused/failed), never by `status` (read-only). Typed emitter `emit_night_mode_toggled`; dedicated deny-by-default `_NIGHT_MODE_TOGGLED_ALLOWLIST` scrub branch + closed-enum VALUE coercion, NEVER `_EMIT_GENERIC_PASSTHROUGH`. DENIED on the wire: any filesystem path (settings overlay, marker), file contents, the raw hostname. NO ATLAS technique (operator-posture provenance, not a detection signal). |
.claude/plans/PLAN-169/repass-ga/diff-ga-4.patch:1016: | v2.27 | PLAN-107 v1.38.0 SPEC v1 backfill (S145) — 62 actions registered closing residual S107-S128 + S134-S143 gaps. Includes: audit_spool_* + audit_flush_dropped_count + skill_cache_stats (PLAN-094); bash_canonical_bypass_invoked (PLAN-085); ceo_boot_persona_coverage_score (PLAN-091); confidence_gate_* (PLAN-100); cost_envelope_capped + execution_context_* + swarm_paused_owner_absent + swarm_runaway_suspected (PLAN-102); federation_* (PLAN-099); goap_* (PLAN-098); kernel_extension_landed + output_scan_finding_suppressed + persona_coverage_synthesized (PLAN-106); persona_auto_* (PLAN-105); phase_c_enforcing_flipped (PLAN-104); rag_* (PLAN-097); sentinel_signer_* (PLAN-099); streaming_* (PLAN-086); mcp_bearer_friction_observed + mcp_cross_tenant_denied + mcp_soak_fpr_breach (PLAN-085); capability_rollout_complete + kill_switch_invoked (PLAN-099). | *(no new fields; per-action allowlists in `audit_emit.py` + spool_writer.py forensic emits)* |
